// arrest_team: suspect s1 has surrendered. The closest free member (a) restrains, the next closest in reach (b)
// covers. Everyone involved is reserved first, freed only after a's restrain is done (the barrier).
// method: squad_tick
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !reserve a
//   2. !reserve b
//   3. !reserve s1
//   4. !restrain a s1
//   5. !cover_target b s1
//   6. !wait_until_done a
//   7. !free a
//   8. !free b
//   9. !free s1

squadmember a
squadmember b
squadmember c
roster (a b c)
enemy s1
enemy s2
near s1 a 2.0
near s1 b 3.0
near s1 c 9.0
near s2 b 2.0
near s2 c 3.0
near s2 a 5.0
surrendered s1
